OL,3,GNEWSASpecialist manikin used for stab
OL,4,Awound training
OL,5,
OL,6,FA training manikin created to mirror
OL,7,Freal-life major trauma such as stab
OL,8,Fwounds is being used by emergency
OL,9,Fworkers practising life-saving
OL,10,Fprocedures.
OL,12,FWatford General Hospital said it would
OL,13,Fprepare them "for real emergencies when
OL,14,Fthere are only seconds to act".
OL,16,FThe dummy lets them practice the
OL,17,F"clamshell" procedure, which is a rapid
OL,18,Fopening of the chest to access the
OL,19,Fheart and lungs to relieve pressure,
OL,20,Fwhich can be a patient's only chance of
OL,21,Fsurvival.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
