OL,4,Awound training
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Daniela Burlacu said it was a
OL,7,F"procedure that most clinicians will
OL,8,Frarely encounter during their careers,
OL,9,Fbut when it is needed there is no time
OL,10,Fto learn on the job".
